{"title":"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 51","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_51&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the highest point (largest possible <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-coordinate) on the parabola\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/f/79fda67b1f2e64588c88901a47c2a1543516d336.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y=-2x^2+ 28x+ 418\\]\" width=\"174\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_51&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>One way to find the highest point is to rewrite the quadratic into vertex form.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/6/6f6b554c46e022add26fe314731226f5391bd881.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y = -2(x^2 - 14x - 209)\\]\" width=\"187\" height=\"19\" />\nComplete the square inside the parentheses.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/8/78875cf0e3d1c63d9ae90e1eb994d21cc23b0d88.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y = -2(x^2 - 14x + 49 - 49 - 209)\\]\" width=\"267\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/9/c596122765dacf49d6bf3b7bfb4936c4bab71637.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y = -2((x-7)^2 - 258)\\]\" width=\"181\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/2/5d2dfe590f7ebd175b086e16a8f4d58389951337.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y = -2(x-7)^2 + 516\\]\" width=\"168\" height=\"19\" />\nThus, the largest possible y-coordinate is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/e/15e72f4556bd472a06e54d480103d90425ffec9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{516}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_51&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest\" title=\"2007 iTest\">2007 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 iTest Answer Key\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_50\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 50\">Problem 50</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_52\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 52\">Problem 52</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b